          "text": " Ammo wonti t'uri qaba tokoleeni keesa inseentu, yokhaani nami waan ch'eera tolchuufi ka d'ara dubbatuleeni. Worra maqa isaani kitaaba jireenna ka Ilme Hoola keesati t'aafani ch'allati seena.",
